  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:70640",
  "description": "The buildah package provides a tool for facilitating building OCI container images. Among other things, buildah enables you to: Create a working container, either from scratch or using an image as a starting point; Create an image, either from a working container or using the instructions in a Dockerfile; Build both Docker and OCI images.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * buildah: Go net/[http:](http:) Unencrypted HTTP/2 connections vulnerable to Denial of Service (CVE-2026-56853)\n  * buildah: Go html/template: Cross-Site Scripting via pathological input (CVE-2026-56858)\n  * buildah: Go encoding/asn1: Denial of Service via excessive recursion in Unmarshal (CVE-2026-33818)\n  * buildah: golang net/url: Denial of Service from quadratic complexity in path resolution (CVE-2026-56860)\n  * buildah: Golang crypto/tls: Denial of Service via indefinite KeyUpdate messages (CVE-2026-56862)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
